    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container research-body">
      <aside class="terms-summary" aria-label="Key points">
        <strong>Key points</strong>
        <p>Our research and tools may contain errors. AI responses and financial projections require independent verification. Closed-testing apps may change or stop working. Keep backups and review actions before authorising them. These terms do not remove any rights or remedies that the law does not allow us to exclude.</p>
